* fefet_preisach.lib -- GENERATED by scripts/gen_fefet_lib.py from device/params/*.json.
* Do not edit by hand: change the JSON (or the generator) and regenerate.
*
* this project v0 FeFET compact model, ngspice-native form (B-sources and 1 F state capacitors).
* Canonical source of the equations: device/veriloga/fefet_preisach.va.
* Equation-by-equation correspondence: docs/device/MODEL_EQUIVALENCE.md.
*
* Use only with transient analysis and 'uic' (the internal node m has no DC path).
* Run ngspice with -n so that a user ~/.spiceinit (e.g. HSPICE compatibility) is not loaded.
*
* Parameter sets (activation fields at equal-probability mid-quantiles, MV/cm):
*  set A: t_FE 8.3 nm, P_S 22.9 uC/cm^2, eps_r 30, tau_inf 3.87e-07 s, alpha 4.11, beta 2.07, V_imp 0.08 V, N 16
*    E_a: 1.236 1.414 1.509 1.579 1.637 1.690 1.739 1.787 1.836 1.887 1.943 2.007 2.085 2.188 2.346 2.714
*  set B: t_FE 10 nm, P_S 23.96 uC/cm^2, eps_r 42.9, tau_inf 3.65e-06 s, alpha 2.936, beta 1.639, V_imp -0.155 V, N 16
*    E_a: 0.738 0.889 0.987 1.069 1.143 1.215 1.285 1.356 1.431 1.511 1.598 1.698 1.816 1.966 2.184 2.630
*  set C: t_FE 8 nm, P_S 1.718 uC/cm^2, eps_r 30, tau_inf 5.645e-09 s, alpha 3.763, beta 1, V_imp 0 V, N 16
*    E_a: 2.224 2.286 2.321 2.349 2.372 2.394 2.414 2.433 2.452 2.472 2.493 2.515 2.540 2.570 2.610 2.683

* fe_core1: 1-domain kinetic Preisach ferroelectric between t and b, general-beta form (R3b).
.subckt fe_core1 t b params: area=1e-12 tfe=10e-9 psat=0.25 epsr=30 tauinf=1e-6 alpha=2 vimp=0
+ gleak=0 beta=1 h0=1e-6 ea1=2e8 x0_1=0
* (R2) NLS rate 1/tau = exp(-min((va/|v+vimp|)^alpha, 200))/tauinf, |v+vimp| floored at 1 mV
.func nlsr(v, va) {exp(-min(pwr(va/max(abs(v+vimp), 1e-3), alpha), 200))/tauinf}
* (R3b) dx/dt = sgn(E)*beta*r*(1 - sgn(E)*x)*(-ln((1 - sgn(E)*x)/2) + h0)^((beta-1)/beta)
.func dxdtg(v, x, va) {sgn(v+vimp)*beta*nlsr(v, va)*(1 - sgn(v+vimp)*x)*pwr(max(-ln(max(0.5*(1 - sgn(v+vimp)*x), 1e-300)), 0) + h0, (beta-1)/beta)}
* domain states: x_i is the voltage on a 1 F capacitor, dx_i/dt = dxdt(V_FE, x_i, E_a,i * t_FE)
Cx1 x1 0 1 ic={x0_1}
Bx1 0 x1 I = dxdtg(v(t,b), v(x1), {ea1*tfe})
* (R4) mean domain state; (R5) polarization current area*psat*d(mean x)/dt,
* sensed as the current into a capacitor of value area*psat driven by the mean
Bsum xs 0 V = (v(x1))/1
Vps xs xsc 0
* its start voltage = mean start state, so no charge is pushed into b at t = 0
Cps xsc 0 {area*psat} ic={(x0_1)/1}
Fpol t b Vps 1
* (R5) linear dielectric part: area*eps0*epsr/tfe
Cfe t b {area*8.854187813e-12*epsr/tfe}
* optional FE leakage conductance (default 0 = off)
Bleak t b I = {gleak}*v(t,b)
.ends fe_core1

