* nfefet_b: channel of the set-B FeFET. UNCALIBRATED STAND-IN BSIM4 card, written by
* hand like models/mosfet/standin45_bsim4.lib, with tox = the SiO2 interlayer and vth0 fitted
* so that the FeFET thresholds land on the set's targets (docs/device/CALIBRATION_v0.md).
.model nfefet_b nmos level=54 version=4.8 toxe=2e-09 toxp=2e-09 toxm=2e-09 vth0=0.1392 xj=1.5e-08
+ u0=0.03 vsat=100000 rdsw=150 cit=0 epsrox=3.9 cgso=1.0e-10 cgdo=1.0e-10 cjs=1.0e-3 cjd=1.0e-3
+ cjsws=1.0e-10 cjswd=1.0e-10

* fefet_b16: FeFET, parameter set B: FE (16 domains) from gate g to internal node m,
* MOSFET nfefet_b (d, m, s, b). dvt = BSIM4 delvto of the channel (V).
* dvg = gate-referred threshold shift (V): a source in series with the gate, so V_th moves by
* exactly dvg in every state (used for Monte Carlo of V_th variation).
* ea1..: per-domain activation fields (V/m), defaults = set quantiles. x0_1..: start states.
.subckt fefet_b16 g d s b params: w=1e-06 l=1e-06 ra=1 dvt=0 dvg=0 rm=1e25 ea1=7.3789e+07
+ ea2=8.88605e+07 ea3=9.87079e+07 ea4=1.06896e+08 ea5=1.1434e+08 ea6=1.21453e+08 ea7=1.28489e+08
+ ea8=1.35642e+08 ea9=1.43098e+08 ea10=1.51064e+08 ea11=1.59816e+08 ea12=1.69758e+08
+ ea13=1.81579e+08 ea14=1.96641e+08 ea15=2.18433e+08 ea16=2.63048e+08 x0_1=0 x0_2=0 x0_3=0 x0_4=0
+ x0_5=0 x0_6=0 x0_7=0 x0_8=0 x0_9=0 x0_10=0 x0_11=0 x0_12=0 x0_13=0 x0_14=0 x0_15=0 x0_16=0
Vdvg g gi {dvg}
Xfe gi m fe_core16 area={w*l*ra} tfe=1e-08 psat=0.23965 epsr=42.9 tauinf=3.6502e-06 alpha=2.9364
+ vimp=-0.155 beta=1.639 h0=1e-06 ea1={ea1} ea2={ea2} ea3={ea3} ea4={ea4} ea5={ea5} ea6={ea6}
+ ea7={ea7} ea8={ea8} ea9={ea9} ea10={ea10} ea11={ea11} ea12={ea12} ea13={ea13} ea14={ea14}
+ ea15={ea15} ea16={ea16} x0_1={x0_1} x0_2={x0_2} x0_3={x0_3} x0_4={x0_4} x0_5={x0_5} x0_6={x0_6}
+ x0_7={x0_7} x0_8={x0_8} x0_9={x0_9} x0_10={x0_10} x0_11={x0_11} x0_12={x0_12} x0_13={x0_13}
+ x0_14={x0_14} x0_15={x0_15} x0_16={x0_16}
M1 d m s b nfefet_b w={w} l={l} delvto={dvt} as={w*9e-08} ad={w*9e-08} ps={2*w+1.8e-07} pd={2*w+1.8e-07}
* (R7) very large resistor m->s: numerical safety only, time constant >> any run
Rm m s {rm}
.ends fefet_b16

* nfefet_c: channel of the set-C FeFET. UNCALIBRATED STAND-IN BSIM4 card, written by
* hand like models/mosfet/standin45_bsim4.lib, with tox = the SiO2 interlayer and vth0 fitted
* so that the FeFET thresholds land on the set's targets (docs/device/CALIBRATION_v0.md).
.model nfefet_c nmos level=54 version=4.8 toxe=1e-09 toxp=1e-09 toxm=1e-09 vth0=0.8133 xj=1.5e-08
+ u0=0.022 vsat=100000 rdsw=150 cit=0.012 epsrox=3.9 cgso=1.0e-10 cgdo=1.0e-10 cjs=1.0e-3 cjd=1.0e-3
+ cjsws=1.0e-10 cjswd=1.0e-10

* fefet_c16: FeFET, parameter set C: FE (16 domains) from gate g to internal node m,
* MOSFET nfefet_c (d, m, s, b). dvt = BSIM4 delvto of the channel (V).
* dvg = gate-referred threshold shift (V): a source in series with the gate, so V_th moves by
* exactly dvg in every state (used for Monte Carlo of V_th variation).
* ea1..: per-domain activation fields (V/m), defaults = set quantiles. x0_1..: start states.
.subckt fefet_c16 g d s b params: w=2e-07 l=1e-07 ra=1 dvt=0 dvg=0 rm=1e25 ea1=2.22381e+08
+ ea2=2.28571e+08 ea3=2.32147e+08 ea4=2.34896e+08 ea5=2.37243e+08 ea6=2.39368e+08 ea7=2.41367e+08
+ ea8=2.43307e+08 ea9=2.45237e+08 ea10=2.47208e+08 ea11=2.49273e+08 ea12=2.51505e+08
+ ea13=2.54018e+08 ea14=2.57026e+08 ea15=2.61047e+08 ea16=2.68313e+08 x0_1=0 x0_2=0 x0_3=0 x0_4=0
+ x0_5=0 x0_6=0 x0_7=0 x0_8=0 x0_9=0 x0_10=0 x0_11=0 x0_12=0 x0_13=0 x0_14=0 x0_15=0 x0_16=0
Vdvg g gi {dvg}
Xfe gi m fe_core16_b1 area={w*l*ra} tfe=8e-09 psat=0.01718 epsr=30 tauinf=5.6451e-09 alpha=3.7631
+ vimp=0 ea1={ea1} ea2={ea2} ea3={ea3} ea4={ea4} ea5={ea5} ea6={ea6} ea7={ea7} ea8={ea8} ea9={ea9}
+ ea10={ea10} ea11={ea11} ea12={ea12} ea13={ea13} ea14={ea14} ea15={ea15} ea16={ea16} x0_1={x0_1}
+ x0_2={x0_2} x0_3={x0_3} x0_4={x0_4} x0_5={x0_5} x0_6={x0_6} x0_7={x0_7} x0_8={x0_8} x0_9={x0_9}
+ x0_10={x0_10} x0_11={x0_11} x0_12={x0_12} x0_13={x0_13} x0_14={x0_14} x0_15={x0_15} x0_16={x0_16}
M1 d m s b nfefet_c w={w} l={l} delvto={dvt} as={w*9e-08} ad={w*9e-08} ps={2*w+1.8e-07} pd={2*w+1.8e-07}
* (R7) very large resistor m->s: numerical safety only, time constant >> any run
Rm m s {rm}
.ends fefet_c16

* fefet_c16_frozen: FeFET of set C with FROZEN domain states, for nanosecond searches only.
* Start it from a saved state: .ic v(<inst>.m)=V_m of the full model. Checked against the
* full model in test 3b (t3b.frozen_equiv).
.subckt fefet_c16_frozen g d s b params: w=2e-07 l=1e-07 ra=1 dvt=0 dvg=0 rm=1e25
Vdvg g gi {dvg}
Cfe gi m {w*l*ra*8.854187813e-12*30/8e-09}
M1 d m s b nfefet_c w={w} l={l} delvto={dvt} as={w*9e-08} ad={w*9e-08} ps={2*w+1.8e-07} pd={2*w+1.8e-07}
Rm m s {rm}
.ends fefet_c16_frozen

